25
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,170
Bathe me, then. / Mm.

26
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,700
Mind your eyes.

27
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,370
Then don't move so much.

28
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:52,500
