45
00:02:07,270 --> 00:02:09,330
Rei, you fucker. The baby. What are you gonna do?

46
00:02:09,330 --> 00:02:11,470
Huh? That's your kid, asshole.

47
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:15,830
This is between me and Mii. Stay the fuck out of it.

48
00:02:15,830 --> 00:02:17,800
Hey, stop! / Rei, you asshole!

49
