Go on, tell me.

62
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Don't touch my friend.

63
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Butt out.

64
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,930
You butt out.

65
00:02:49,430 --> 00:02:51,500
Make me happy?

66
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:53,800
Fine. I'll tell you.

67
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:56,329
Get out of my life.

68
00:02:59,130 --> 00:03:00,400
And stay away from me.

69
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,630
Go!

70
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:04,670
Didn't you hear my friend? Go!

71
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,170
You're not me. You don't get it.

72
00:03:07,170 --> 00:03:08,430
Why don't you try being me?

73
00:03:08,430 --> 00:03:10,930
Even if I were you, I'd never leave Mii alone.

74
00:03:11,270 --> 00:03:13,030
That baby is yours.

75
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:14,570
