76
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:20,230
Just go. / Go!

77
00:03:20,230 --> 00:03:22,030
And don't you ever come back.

78
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:23,700
My friend loves me more than you do.

79
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:27,100
Go. Get out.

80
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:29,200
